 "entries": {
  "Remains of the Cursed#001": {
   "src": "The figure urges you towards the door.",
   "dst": "その人物は、あなたをドアの方へと促している。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#002": {
   "src": "It's a rotting wooden board with plans for attacks against the Queen and her army. A few of them even have notes with years marked...",
   "dst": "それは、女王とその軍隊に対する攻撃計画が記された、腐りかけた木の板だ。その中には、年号が記されたメモが添えられているものさえいくつかある……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#003": {
   "src": "{~} RA - Cursed. As if. The only one that need be cursed is Her. As is, just two people won't make a difference. But we're not the only ones.",
   "dst": "{~} RA - 呪われた？　とんでもない。呪われるべきなのは彼女だけだ。現状では、たった二人では何も変わらない。だが、私たちだけじゃない。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#004": {
   "src": "{~} RA - Enough hiding down here, in these dilapidated ruins. We've finally reclaimed enough space up top to start constructing our own outpost. Free from Her rule.",
   "dst": "{~} RA - もう、この荒れ果てた廃墟の底で隠れ続けるのはやめよう。ようやく上の方で、自分たちの前哨基地を建設し始めるのに十分なスペースを取り戻した。彼女の支配から解放されて。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#005": {
   "src": "{~} RA - Our forces grow. Our plans grow with them. The patrols have recently started picking up, and we've even caught a glimpse of Her messenger. How much longer can we sit idly?",
   "dst": "{~} RA - 我々の戦力は増大している。それに伴い、計画も拡大している。最近、パトロールの頻度が高まってきており、彼女の使者の姿さえちらりと目撃した。これ以上、いつまで手をこまねいていられるだろうか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#006": {
   "src": "{~} RA - We've attacked enough patrols. We've trained long enough. It's finally time. Our revolution starts the day after our Assassin retrieves the army's plans against us. She will not rule for long. -H",
   "dst": "{~} RA - パトロール隊への襲撃も十分だ。訓練も十分に積んだ。いよいよその時が来た。我々の革命は、暗殺者が軍が我々に対して立てた作戦計画を奪還した翌日から始まる。彼女の支配は長くは続かない。 -H",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#007": {
   "src": "It's full of ancient books and texts, most completely illegible. One scroll, less harmed, catches your eye...",
   "dst": "そこには古書や古文書が所狭しと並んでいるが、そのほとんどは全く判読できない。その中で比較的傷みの少ない一巻の巻物が、自分の目に留まる……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#008": {
   "src": "We must remain vigilant. We must remain vengeful. And above all else, we must remain organized. To that end, we must know how to best channel our power.",
   "dst": "我々は警戒を怠ってはならない。復讐心を失ってはならない。そして何よりも、組織力を維持しなければならない。そのためには、我々の力をいかにして最も効果的に発揮させるかを理解しなければならない。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#009": {
   "src": "I've already lost too much time spread thin over all kinds of foci. To pick just one, and specialize... that has let even those weaker among our midst gain unimaginable force.",
   "dst": "私はすでに、あらゆる分野に手を広げすぎて、あまりにも多くの時間を無駄にしてしまった。たった一つを選び、その分野に特化すること……それによって、私たちの中でも特に能力の低い者たちでさえ、想像を絶するほどの力を手に入れることができたのだ。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#010": {
   "src": "Thus far, those deemed Archers and Warriors have seen most success. the idea of having the select few be Assassins is also rising in popularity, due to the need for stealthy takedowns.",
   "dst": "これまでのところ、「アーチャー」や「ウォリアー」と見なされる者たちが最も大きな成功を収めている。また、ステルスによる排除が必要とされることから、「アサシン」となる選りすぐりの者たちを配置するという考えも、人気を集めつつある。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#011": {
   "src": "Should any other form of foci and specialization prove effective, it will surely be documented. May our revolution succeed. -X",
   "dst": "もし他の形態の拠点や専門化が有効であることが証明されれば、それは間違いなく記録されるだろう。我らの革命が成功することを願う。-X",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#012": {
   "src": "Your very own class is eerily similar to one of the specializations mentioned here. But... why would they be mentioned here in the first place?",
   "dst": "自分のクラスと、ここで挙げられている専門分野の一つが不気味なほど似ている。でも……そもそも、なぜそれらがここに挙げられているんだ？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#013": {
   "src": "It's fragments of the plans the Royal Army had for the complete and utter annihilation of an outpost of the Cursed. They're dated to {~} RA.",
   "dst": "これは、王立軍が「呪われた者たち」の前哨基地を完全かつ徹底的に殲滅するために立てた計画の断片だ。その日付は{~} RAとされている。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#014": {
   "src": "Several of the planned attacks are circled, with countermeasures written next to them in noticably different color. At the bottom, there's a note in that same color.",
   "dst": "計画されている攻撃のいくつかは丸で囲まれており、その横には明らかに異なる色で対策が記されている。下部には、同じ色の注記がある。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#015": {
   "src": "They expect us to twiddle our thumbs. That will prove their final mistake. Tomorrow, revolution begins. -X",
   "dst": "奴らは、俺たちがただ手をこまねいているだけだと思っている。それが奴らの最後の大間違いだと証明してやる。明日、革命が始まる。 -X",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": ""
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#016": {
   "src": "That's the last of them!... huff... Any other soldiers left?",
   "dst": "これで最後だ！…はあ…他に兵士は残ってるか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Zander"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#017": {
   "src": "There's another battalion approaching! Keep your eyes peeled and prepare to strike once more!",
   "dst": "また別の大隊が接近している！ 警戒を怠らず、再び攻撃する準備をしておけ！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Hawke"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#018": {
   "src": "Don't lose hope now! We've fought through worse - we shall succeed today too!",
   "dst": "今こそ希望を捨ててはいけない！これまでももっと厳しい状況を乗り越えてきたのだから、今日も必ず成功する！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#019": {
   "src": "Wh-? Men, halt your advance! Her Majesty delivers a message for us!",
   "dst": "えっ？　諸君、前進を止めよ！　陛下から我々への伝言がある！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Captain Duilio"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#020": {
   "src": "...? But why would She- no, we wouldn't dare defy Her orders, of course not, but... May we know the rationale?",
   "dst": "…？　でも、なぜ彼女――いや、我々が彼女の命令に逆らうなんて、とんでもない、もちろんそんなことはあり得ないが……その理由を教えていただけませんか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Captain Duilio"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#021": {
   "src": "Ah. Very well. Yes, we shall submit the incident report once this is taken care of.",
   "dst": "ああ。承知しました。はい、この件が片付いたら、事故報告書を提出いたします。",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Captain Duilio"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#022": {
   "src": "MEN! RETREAT! BY HER MAJESTY'S ORDERS, YOU ARE TO HALT YOUR MARCH AND RETREAT! HEED MY WORDS AND RUN, IF YOU DO NOT WISH TO FACE HER MAJESTY'S WRATH!",
   "dst": "諸君！撤退せよ！女王陛下の命令により、行軍を中止し、撤退せよ！女王陛下の怒りを招きたくないのなら、私の言葉に従い、走って逃げろ！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Captain Duilio"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#023": {
   "src": "Is it finally over? Is she finally acquiescing?",
   "dst": "ついに終わったのだろうか？　彼女はついに承諾したのだろうか？",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Hawke"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#024": {
   "src": "It... seems so. Our efforts are finally bearing fruit... Behold!",
   "dst": "どうやら……そのようだ。我々の努力がついに実を結びつつある……ご覧あれ！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#025": {
   "src": "This is merely our first victory of many! Even Her Majesty's forces can not hope to match our might and unity!",
   "dst": "これは、これから続く数々の勝利の、ほんの始まりに過ぎない！　女王陛下の軍勢でさえ、我々の力と団結には到底敵わない！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#026": {
   "src": "Regroup and celebrate, as our revolution finall",
   "dst": "再び結束し、祝おう。私たちの革命がついに",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#027": {
   "src": "...ha. So it was all... all for nothing? No... if this is where I die... It must not have been in vain...",
   "dst": "…はあ。じゃあ、すべてが……すべて無駄だったのか？　いや……もしここで死ぬのなら……決して無駄ではなかったはずだ……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#028": {
   "src": "Curse you, Monarch, Usurper! Our flame shan't die out here! No matter how you wish, your reign won't last forever!",
   "dst": "くそっ、君主よ、簒奪者め！　我らの炎はここで消えることはない！　お前の望みがいかに強くとも、お前の支配は永遠には続かない！",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#029": {
   "src": "If you wish to say we are cursed, I'll gladly curse that blasted monarchy of yours! One day, you'll see, the children of this forest will finally-",
   "dst": "もし我々が呪われていると言うのなら、私は喜んで、お前のその忌々しい君主制を呪ってやる！　いつか、きっとわかるさ。この森の子供たちはついに――",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#030": {
   "src": "Kahhhh...",
   "dst": "ゴホッ…ゴホッ…",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  },
  "Remains of the Cursed#031": {
   "src": "Finally prove... nothing...... forever......",
   "dst": "ついに証明された……何も……永遠に……",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Remains of the Cursed",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "Xanthos"
  }
 }
}
